§ `VerifyConstantsFixture`

-- A decision whose body is the literal FALSE or TRUE (smucclaw/l4-ide#1095).
--
-- An encoding records "the text says no" this way, or switches a provision
-- off. There is nothing in such a body to check, so `l4 verify` lists each of
-- these as a constant, reports no finding, and exits 0 -- in both spellings,
-- `DECIDE ... IF` and `... MEANS`.
--
-- verify-constants-read-through.l4 holds the controls that keep their
-- findings.

GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the schedule applies` IF FALSE

GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`the waiver was signed` MEANS FALSE

GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the rule is in force` IF TRUE
